   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>I&#39;m already struggling for a while with our shiny server. I basically have 2 issues which I want to explain with some screenshots. We are running shiny server pro on Ubuntu 14.04.4 LTS (GNU/Linux 3.13.0-74-generic x86_64)</div><div>But I first want to explain a bit about the app set up. So I have a global.r where data is being loaded (50 secs +-). That data should be used by all 4 different users that have access to the app. So what I would expect, that once I (maintainer of the app) log in the data is loaded and that the others don&#39;t have that loading time anymore.</div><div>1.</div><div>But that is not the case. It looks like the data is loaded for each user as each user has the long loading time. And I think this is confirmed by the huge amount of memory used (attachedmnet memory_load.png)</div><div><br></div><div>2.</div><div>The admin page does not show the connected users and keeps on showing an old app</div><div>In the no_user_participant01.PNG you can see that only an old (Actually deleted) app is shown and the new connection is not there. And the strange thing, the process is there but the connection not, as you can see in Process_is_there.PNG</div><div>And besides that, after restarting the server everything behaves the same. What&#39;s also strange, is that the memory on the admin page stays 12.95GB. Even after I have killed all shiny processes and the linux htop function shows hardly any memory usage.</div><div><br></div><div>cfg file:</div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Consolas\">run_as shiny;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-family:Consolas\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-family:Consolas\">auth_passwd_file /etc/shiny-server/passwd;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-family:Consolas\">preserve_logs true;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-family:Consolas\">application;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-family:Consolas\">auth_frame_options allow;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-family:Consolas\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-family:Consolas\">server {<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-family:Consolas\">  ssl path_to_our_file(made_up);<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-family:Consolas\">  listen\r\n3838 127.0.0.1;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-family:Consolas\"> \r\nframe_options allow;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-family:Consolas\"> \r\ndisable_protocols websocket xdr-polling;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-family:Consolas\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-family:Consolas\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-family:Consolas\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-family:Consolas\">         \r\nlocation /ASR_DEV2 {<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-family:Consolas\">               \r\napp_dir /home/tim/ASR_dev2;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-family:Consolas\">               \r\nlog_dir /var/log/shiny-server;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-family:Consolas\">               \r\ndirectory_index off;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-family:Consolas\">               \r\nutilization_scheduler 2 .8 8;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-family:Consolas\">               \r\napp_session_timeout 900;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-family:Consolas\">                app_init_timeout\r\n240;<u